    "title": "Great Barrington Selectboard approves plan to repair sinkhole on Division Street bridge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shaw Israel Izikson ,\n9 hours ago Great Barrington — At a meeting held on Zoom on Tuesday, April 14, the Selectboard approved a plan to repair the sinkhole on the Division Street bridge. The bridge has been closed to traffic since March 20, when the sinkhole was discovered on the east side of the temporary bridge abutment. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
